{"version":1,"content":"<p>開發者Archit Khode推出了一個名為GPU Demo Gallery的網頁項目，<strong>將3dfx、NVIDIA和ATI在上世紀90年代末至本世紀初推出的經典顯卡技術演示，重新搬進瀏覽器，</strong>老玩家無需尋找當年的顯卡和驅動，就能再次體驗這些曾經驚豔一時的畫面。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588196.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:03:52.160147+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_hash":"8b88fba19e8734d05d1e41a37a5666487aa5303ccad5eb7b48cee0ec7500f679","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}